PHOENIX-COND quadratic table 15
--------------------------------
The companion file `claret-2017-tess-table15-phoenix-cond.csv` retains all
`Mod=PC, Type=q` rows from CDS/VizieR J/A+A/600/A30/tableab, the
quasi-spherical PHOENIX-COND quadratic LSM coefficients of Claret (2017)
Table 1, Table 15. Retrieval URL:
https://vizier.cfa.harvard.edu/viz-bin/asu-tsv?-source=J%2FA%2BA%2F600%2FA30%2Ftableab&-out.max=unlimited
Retrieved UTC 2026-11-04T19:40:00Z.
The CSV preserves `logg,Teff,Z,L/HP,aLSM,bLSM` verbatim; L/HP is the mixing
length, not the ATLAS `xi` microturbulent velocity. The original table has
holes and solar metallicity only. The preceding CDS attribution terms apply.
